OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces highlights
OL,7,     Ffrom the Proms including music by
OL,8,     FSibelius plus chamber performances
OL,9,     Ffrom this years Ryedale Festival
OL,10,     Fand Baroque music from Fribourg.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mozart
OL,12,     F1/1. Kate Molleson tells Mozart's
OL,13,     Fstory through five of the
OL,14,     Frelationships that shaped the
OL,15,     Fcomposer and his music - from his
OL,16,     Ffriends and family to a mentor and
OL,17,     Fa supposed rival.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FKatie chats to Alexandra Dariescu
OL,20,     Fand Jacob Muhlrad about their BBC
OL,21,     FProms.
